# Feature list gap roadmap (phased)

Source: [`.cursor/plans/feature_list.md`](.cursor/plans/feature_list.md). Baseline: Phases 0–11 largely shipped (Markdown, tags, todos, modules, Kanban, wiki, Excalidraw, palette, backups, assistant). This plan covers **remaining gaps only**.

**Locked decisions**
- Disabled project modules: **Settings-only** — hide from Project middle-nav and tabs until enabled (no inline Create/Enable opportunity in the main view).
- Task Priority: `none | low | medium | high | urgent`.
- Tasks may have `projectId = null` (Lists / Unsorted).
- Canvas: darker background + layout assist first; Lucid-style auto-routing / text→ERD deferred to a late polish phase.
- Out of scope: Calendar / Filesystem / Image Board stubs.

