## Phase N14 — Ideas list + middle-nav sort

**Goal:** Ideas main pane as a real list; middle nav sorts work and reverse.

**UI**
- [`IdeasListPage.tsx`](client/src/pages/IdeasListPage.tsx): list rows (not card grid); open on double-click or clear row action → existing idea page/modal pattern.
- [`useShellNav.ts`](client/src/lib/useShellNav.ts): middle-nav options — Date created, Title Alphabetical, Grouped by Tags. Clicking active sort toggles asc/desc (URL params `sort` + `order`).
- Wire API/client fetch to honor sort (client-side OK initially if list is small; prefer server query if already paginated).

**Exit:** All three sorts + reverse verified; Priority nav stub removed or left disabled only if intentionally deferred (feature list does not require Idea priority).

