## Phase N16 — Tags on remaining record types

**Goal:** “All record types” tagging.

- Wire `TagInput` onto: boards, canvases, todo lists, wiki pages (and wiki_node/canvas entities as appropriate).
- Extend search ([`src/routes/v1/search.ts`](src/routes/v1) / client search) to include those types when tagged/queried.
- No change to existing TagChip / 3-char suggest / hover × / right-click ColorPopover behavior.

**Exit:** Tag a board and a canvas; search/filter finds them.

