## Phase N18 — Canvas visual polish

**Goal:** Match feature_list canvas chrome without full diagram automation yet.

- Darker grey Excalidraw background than app chrome ([`excalidrawScene.ts`](client/src/lib/excalidrawScene.ts) — stop forcing light `#f8f9fa`).
- Shape/fill color via same ColorPopover behavior as tags (prefer context/right-click or consistent Fill affordance).
- Layout assist bar: align / distribute / grid spacing (extend [`CanvasLayoutBar.tsx`](client/src/components/CanvasLayoutBar.tsx)).

**Exit:** Dark canvas + color UX + basic spacing tools.

