## Phase N19 — Project nav / modules cleanup

**Goal:** Align Project shell with Settings-only disabled modules + complete module coverage.

- Middle nav / tabs: only **enabled** modules; disabled stay out of nav (Settings Enable remains the path).
- Ensure middle nav includes all enabled module types that exist as tabs today (`todo_lists`, `documents` if distinct from wiki, boards, wiki, canvases, tasks) — fix current omissions.
- Overview still links into enabled views only.

**Exit:** Enabling/disabling a module correctly shows/hides nav + tabs; no Create opportunity for disabled types.

