## Phase N20 — Canvas diagram assists (deferred polish)

**Goal:** Architecture / ERD entry points without blocking prior phases.

- Templates or insert helpers for system-architecture and ERD-style starters (Excalidraw library / seeded frames).
- Optional text→diagram (Mermaid/D2 render → place on canvas) if complexity stays bounded; otherwise templates-only is the exit bar.
- Smart line routing beyond Excalidraw defaults only if feasible without a second graph engine.

**Exit:** User can start an architecture or ERD canvas quickly; document limits in QA notes.

